{"ok":true,"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/AP/record/SWS_PER_00046","versions":[{"version_id":"AUTOSAR/AP/record/SWS_PER_00046@rel:R25-11#91434584","canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/AP/record/SWS_PER_00046","release":"R25-11","content":"function SetValue [SWS_PER_00046] Upstream: RS_PER_00003 , RS_PER_00010 , RS_AP_00119 , RS_AP_00120 , RS_ AP_00121, RS_AP_00127 , RS_AP_00128 , RS_AP_00129 , RS_AP_00135 , RS_AP_00136 , RS_AP_00139 , RS_AP_00159 template &lt;class T&gt; ara::core::Result &lt; void &gt; SetValue ( ara::core::StringView key, const T &amp;value) noexcept; Stores a key-value pair in this Key-Value Storage. If a value already exists and has the same data type as the new value, it is overwritten. If the new value has a different data type than the stored value, kDataTypeMismatch is returned. SetValue may be delayed by an ongoing call from another thread to RemoveAllKeys, SyncTo Storage, or DiscardPendingChanges, or to SetValue, GetValue, GetCurrentValueSize, Remove Key, RecoverKey, or ResetKey for the same key-value pair. This method uses transaction semantics, the changes only take effect when SyncToStorage is called. Header-Datei #include \"ara/per/key_value_storage.h\" class mono Scope class ara::per::KeyValueStorage class mono Exception-Sicherheit exception safe class mono Thread-Sicherheit thread-safe PerErrc ::kIllegalWrite rollback_semantics class mono Template-Parameter th Parameter th Beschreibung td T td The type of the value that shall be set. Parameter (in) th Parameter th Beschreibung td key td The key to assign the value to. td value td The value to store. Rückgabewert th Typ th Beschreibung td ara::core::Result &lt; void &gt; td A Result of void. In case of an error, it contains any of the errors defined below, or a vendor specific error. Fehler th Fehlercode th Beschreibung td Access td Returned if the Key-Value Storage is configured as read- only, or if it is configured as write-only-once and the key already exists. td PerErrc ::kPhysicalStorageFailure td rollback_semantics Returned if access to the physical storage fails. td PerErrc ::kIntegrityCorrupted td rollback_semantics Returned if stored data cannot be written because the structural integrity is corrupted. td PerErrc ::kEncryptionFailed td rollback_semantics Returned if the encryption or decryption of stored data fails. td PerErrc ::kDataTypeMismatch td rollback_semantics Returned if the data type of an already stored value does not match the templated type. td PerErrc ::kOutOfStorageSpace td rollback_semantics Returned if the available physical storage space is insufficient for the new value. td PerErrc ::kQuotaExceeded td rollback_semantics Returned if the new value would exceed the configured maximum AllowedSize of the Key-Value Storage. td PerErrc ::kAuthenticationFailed td rollback_semantics Returned if calculating or checking the MAC of stored data fails.","meta":{"trigger_kind":"baseline_sync"},"recorded_at":"2026-09-30T16:43:34+00:00","text_key":"89e30c92567e"}],"lifecycle":{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/AP/record/SWS_PER_00046","is_dropped":false,"first_active_release":"R25-11","last_active_release":"R25-11","dropped_in":[],"first_dropped_release":null,"absent_before":["R19-11","R20-11","R21-11","R22-11","R23-11","R24-11"],"platform_releases":["R19-11","R20-11","R21-11","R22-11","R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"latest_platform_release":"R25-11"},"element":{"kind":"function","name":"SetValue","module":"PER","cluster":"","page":"classes/cl_ara_per_KeyValueStorage_e55123.html","doc_type":"SWS","ai":false,"first":"R25-11","last":"R25-11","changed":[],"distinct":1,"universe":"AP"},"evidence":{"figures":[{"id":"FIG-a7fb203ed1bcd70a","doc":"AUTOSAR_EXP_SWArchitecture","p":157,"rel":[],"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"SetValue stores key-value pair in storage","n":6,"cap":"","sha":null,"nser":0,"src":"matrix"},{"id":"FIG-ac91624831463dd9","doc":"AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_UpdateAndConfigurationManagement","p":18,"rel":[],"role":"constitutive"